;; kami-engine is an umbrella repository: it has no source of its own at the
;; root (there is no src/ here). The tools.deps manifests are the per-module
;; ones -- kami-render/deps.edn, kami-physics/deps.edn and
;; kami-clj-play/games/survivors/deps.edn -- and CI runs scripts/ directly.
;;
;; This file existed as a zero-byte placeholder from 2026-07-18 ("rescue:
;; preserve dependency WIP", 0 additions) until 2026-08-13. It is kept, rather
;; than deleted, because it is load-bearing: a consumer that points
;; :local/root at this repository needs a manifest here, and removing the file
;; turns that consumer's classpath build into "Manifest file not found"
;; (measured 2026-08-13 against kami-app-isekai's :cljs-game alias, which
;; declares io.github.kotoba-lang/kami-engine-clj {:local/root "../kami-engine"}).
;;
;; :paths is explicitly empty. An absent :paths defaults to ["src"], which
;; would put a directory that does not exist on every consumer's classpath.
{:paths []}
